          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained reductions in civilian and industrial power and fuel supplies force temporary factory shutdowns, production deratings and delayed capacity ramp-ups at energy‑intensive EU auto plants, lowering effective local manufacturing capacity." />
