          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising long‑term bond yields raise government borrowing costs and pressure public budgets, prompting higher taxes or spending trade‑offs that reduce domestic appetite for costly foreign military and energy support, lowering public political support for sustained involvement." />
