          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising capital flows into technology increase available financing for EV and component startups and for OEM capital expenditures, accelerating the build‑out of localized vehicle and powertrain manufacturing capacity in China or the EU." />
